OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer sentenced over
OL,4,Asexual assaults
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former police officer who admitted
OL,7,Fsexually assaulting colleagues has been
OL,8,Fgiven a suspended prison sentence.
OL,10,FAlex Trusler, 36, who was a response
OL,11,Fofficer with the Staffordshire force,
OL,12,Fhad pleaded guilty in July to four
OL,13,Fcounts of sexual assault against three
OL,14,Fwomen.
OL,16,FOn Tuesday at Northampton Crown Court
OL,17,Fhe was told by judge Rebecca Crane that
OL,18,Fhis "leacherous and predatory"
OL,19,Fbehaviour - some of which happened in
OL,20,Fthe workplace - had not only affected
OL,21,Fhis victims but also undermined public
OL,22,Fconfidence in policing.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
